      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Creativity comparison\n\nPlace the unmodified Hugging Face repository **kandinskylab/Kandinsky-ImageSR-2.0** (model_index.json, transformer/, vae/) in `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/Kandinsky-ImageSR-2.0/` and select it in the loader.\n\nOne loader feeds five upscalers (creativity 0, 2, 4, 6, 8), so the model is loaded once. Each output is saved with its setting in the filename prefix (`kandinsky_sr/x2_creativity_N`). Higher creativity is a stronger correction, not a quality dial: compare faces, text and fine textures against the input."
      ],
      "title": "Kandinsky ImageSR",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
